sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 用户
    participant CP as ConfigPanel
    participant Adapter as VideoParamAdapter
    participant TB as VideoTriggerBar
    participant Collapse as SummaryCollapse
    participant Pos as ViewportPositioner
    participant Pop as VideoParamPopover
    participant Kind as ControlKindResolver
    participant Store as CanvasStore
    participant Gate as 提交闸 / 有效输入

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
    Note over CP, Gate: 场景 0: 节点挂载 — 只读投影，不改 params 字段
    CP->>Adapter: resolveEffectiveVideoParams(params, schema, catalog, upstreams)
    Adapter-->>CP: EffectiveVideoParams (operation / showModeUi / schema)
    CP->>TB: slots = 摘要段列表
    TB->>Collapse: collapseSummary(slots, clientWidth)
    Collapse-->>TB: hidden / iconOnly / ellipsis；chevron 永不丢
    Note over Gate: blockGenerate / quietReason / pendingAdjustment 路径不变
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 240)
    Note over User, Pop: 场景 1: 打开浮层
    User->>TB: 点击 Summary Bar
    TB->>CP: onToggle()
    CP->>Pos: calculatePopoverPosition(rect, viewport)
    Pos->>Pos: width = min(360, viewport-24)；flip 逻辑不变
    Pos-->>CP: PopoverPosition
    CP->>Pop: Portal → document.body（nowheel nodrag）
    Pop->>Kind: resolveControlKind(生成方式 labels)
    Kind-->>Pop: choice-tile（长中文）或 segment（短标签）
    end

    rect rgb(255, 250, 240)
    Note over User, Store: 场景 2: 改参数 — 字段名与 adapter 语义冻结
    User->>Pop: 选 Tile / Aspect / Pill / CompactToggle
    Pop->>CP: onParamChange(key, value) key ∈ keyof VideoNodeParams
    CP->>Store: updateParam（operation / aspectRatio / resolution / duration / sound）
    Store-->>CP: 新 params
    CP->>Adapter: resolveEffectiveVideoParams
    Adapter-->>CP: 新 EffectiveVideoParams
    CP->>TB: 重算摘要折叠
    Note over Pop, Gate: 禁止写 generationMode；ops≤1 不渲染生成方式 DOM
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 245)
    Note over User, Gate: 场景 3: 模型切换与提交（本迭代零改动）
    User->>CP: 切换模型
    CP->>Adapter: buildVideoParamTransition(...)
    Adapter-->>CP: params + 可选 pendingVideoParamAdjustment
    User->>CP: 点击生成
    CP->>Gate: blockGenerate / disabledReason
    Gate-->>User: 与 node-input-submission 一致；UI 重构不得放宽或收紧
    end

    rect rgb(240, 240, 255)
    Note over User, Pop: 场景 4: 关闭
    User->>Pop: Esc / 外点 / 再次点击 Trigger
    Pop->>CP: onClose()
    CP->>TB: isOpen=false（brand 描边收回，chevron 回转）
    end
